#: scenario2:scenario2_E22FE049_A88F_43A9_8CD7_3982BE88FFB9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4625e86adf8eb859799ce4ca6cbc32e1bb02a3203bbcf2c130ebadef668da53a
