msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_E22FE049_A88F_43A9_8CD7_3982BE88FFB9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Her once-porcelain skin was no longer even sickly pale; ⟪k:4⟫it was now the "
"bloodless color of dirt."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Sua pele outrora de porcelana não estava mais sequer pálida; ⟪k:4⟫agora tinha "
"uma cor terrosa, desprovida de sangue."

#: scenario2:scenario2_A1EC3F07_1EE7_43DF_A689_6A4096078902
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 68578274c759b3584b35d66ae132cc534dcbc775a8cda8525c95f83ff69f0628
#. default-sha256: 8e61d889cdc052510cffa6afce62e093f035fc7639cae9d941bf362b45a5a03f
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A1EC3F07_1EE7_43DF_A689_6A4096078902"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She was sprawled haphazardly out on the cellar floor, dried blood stains around her half-"
"open mouth."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ela estava esparramada ao acaso no chão do porão, manchas de sangue seco ao redor de sua "
"boca entreaberta."

#: scenario2:scenario2_32C72CC7_B3DD_449E_92AE_11F7B5E9653C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 12547743d21d212530cdecd4d1935dd8d2a99176e58efb9a2c5c2be96143607f
#. default-sha256: f4d022c2a17480b48b8bea9e37f7920ef2638c33823c1ae6249806680b0a3d00
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_32C72CC7_B3DD_449E_92AE_11F7B5E9653C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And those lips were, naturally, lacking their former rosen sheen."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E aqueles lábios estavam, naturalmente, sem seu antigo brilho rosado."

#: scenario2:scenario2_80D20F98_39D0_487E_819C_2D75F6AF6F1E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d282bafe6776d5fecf5719f6a4b026574530a7639fcd2a0408f1b74351535895
#. default-sha256: d202333a86abbf8f3ac7103b29e4a906e7d656ea2a3dd3d7ef94dd336960d70a
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_80D20F98_39D0_487E_819C_2D75F6AF6F1E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Her body was covered with an array of wounds, but the most prominent was the man’s singular "
"sword standing tall in her chest."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Seu corpo estava coberto com uma série de feridas, mas o mais proeminente era a espada "
"singular do homem erguida em seu peito."

